2026-09-11T06:59:26.2945939Z #-- docs:       Save doc directories specified by DOC_DIRS
2026-09-11T06:59:26.2946467Z #-- libtool:    Leave libtool (.la) files in packages
2026-09-11T06:59:26.2946989Z #-- staticlibs: Leave static library (.a) files in packages
2026-09-11T06:59:26.2947535Z #-- emptydirs:  Leave empty directories in packages
